chezmoi dots — Manage, verify and render dotfiles

USAGE
  chezmoi dots [command] [arguments] [options]

COMMANDS
  edit       Edit dotfiles source (default command)
  view       Preview rendered dotfiles
  list       List configured editable registry components
  lint       Check registries and rendered templates
  audit      Audit live shell configuration
  outdated   Every tool: installed, pinned and latest versions
  bump       Update pinned versions and checksums
  upgrade    Run system and dotfile upgrade steps
  version    Print version information
  help       Show command help

ARGUMENTS
  command  Default: edit. With no selector, open the interactive picker.
  An unrecognized first token is an edit selector, not a command.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  See command help for relevant environment variables.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots
  chezmoi dots help view
  chezmoi dots view --help
